\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5}{\ignorespaces Database entity-relationship diagram. All tables use UUID primary keys. RLS policies enforce per-user access. The dashed line indicates an optional foreign key (pitch books may or may not reference a template).}}{29}{figure.caption.24}%
