\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13}{\ignorespaces Vitest UI showing all 14 test files and 134 tests passing across the three apps. The right panel displays the selected test's source code and can switch to console output on failure.}}{46}{figure.caption.35}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {14}{\ignorespaces Cypress test runner showing the E2E spec files grouped by feature area.}}{47}{figure.caption.38}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {15}{\ignorespaces A passing Cypress test. The left panel shows each automated step (clicking elements, checking text), and the right panel shows the browser state at each step.}}{48}{figure.caption.39}%
\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces A failing Cypress test. The assertion expected either pitch book cards or an empty state message, but the data had not loaded yet when the check ran. This was a test logic error, not an application bug.}}{48}{figure.caption.40}%
